[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730537493","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-3730537493","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":3730537493,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eW3wV","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T20:54:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T20:54:21Z","body":"Hypothetically this structure can also resolve https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100772. The problem occurring there is that \r\n\r\n1. Label is Instantiated, has a value directly assigned to Text\r\n2. Label has text added to the TagStack/ItemTree via Add_text\r\n3. Label is added to SceneTree, which triggers NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE, triggering a set_text to original Text value, discarding the TagStack/Item Tree\r\n\r\nChanging the set text call in Notification Enter Tree to _set_text(text + leading_text + terminating_text) would not discard any information that was added before the Node entered tree, and would behave the same in all other cases as far as I understand.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3730537493/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733754045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-3733754045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":3733754045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ejJC9","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T00:32:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T05:02:45Z","body":"Just pushed more functionality for this. \r\n\r\n* Improved Internal Logic, and fixed a few errors\r\n* Added parameter generation for many BBCode tags\r\n* Caught an error where append_text would ignore existing open Bold / Italics tags. (Unrelated to this PR, or existing issue reports - present in Godot Master & 4.5.1)\r\n\r\nSample Test Case:\r\n\r\nOriginal BBCode String: \"It's also possible to include [img=24x25]res://unicorn_icon.png[/img] [font_size=24]custom images[/font_size], as well as [color=aqua][url=https://godotengine.org]custom URLs[/url][/color]. [hint=This displays a hint.]Hover this to display a tooltip![/hint]\"\r\n\r\nGDScript recreation Code:\r\n```\r\nRTL.add_text(\"It's also...\")\r\n\tRTL.add_image(unicorn, 24, 25)\r\n\tRTL.add_text(\" \")\r\n\tRTL.push_font_size(24)\r\n\tRTL.add_text(\"custom images\")\r\n\tRTL.pop()\r\n\tRTL.add_text(\"as well as \")\r\n\tRTL.push_color(Color.AQUA)\r\n\tRTL.append_text(\"[url=https://godotengine.org]custom URLs\")\r\n\tRTL.pop_all()\r\n\tRTL.add_text(\". \")\r\n\tRTL.push_hint(\"This displays a hint\")\r\n\tRTL.add_text(\"Hover this\")\r\n\tRTL.pop()\r\n\tprint(RTL.text)\r\n```\r\n\r\nGenerated BBScript String: \"It's also...[img color=ffffffff height=25.0 width=24.0 region=0.0,0.0,0.0,0.0 pad=false tooltip= valign=c,c alt=]res://unicorn_icon.png[/img] [font_size=24]custom images[/font_size]as well as [color=00ffffff][url=https://godotengine.org]custom URLs[/url][/color]. [hint=\"This displays a hint\"]Hover this[/hint]\"\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3733754045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764928179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-3764928179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":3764928179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gaD6z","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T05:22:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T05:22:35Z","body":"Just pushed a 'finished' build and removed the Draft Flag from this PR. The code should be able to generate correct BBCode for all Items, and in my testing so far it has. Updated the top-level comment with current info/description.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3764928179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4448457064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-4448457064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":4448457064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCSYRaA","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T07:02:44Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T07:02:44Z","body":"Being able to get the full bbcode from `text` would be very useful in some situations, but I just want to confirm my understanding of your description (not having particularly looked at the code): it sounds like you are updating the internal tag stack when text is appended, and updating the text when the stack is modified; does this affect `append_text()`'s description, where it says that you cannot close a tag pushed in a previous call? For instance, the following currently doesn't work properly:\r\n```gdscript\r\nrtl.push_italics()\r\nrtl.append_text(\"[code]test\")\r\nrtl.append_text(\"[/code] test[/i] test\")\r\n```\r\nas `[/i]` doesn't actually close the italics tag added by `push_italics()`. Also, how is performance affected for large labels (thousands of lines with BBCode, regularly appending more lines) compared to what we currently have?\r\n\r\nIf there is no performance caveat to this approach, then it sounds to me like it would make editing RichTextLabel contents much easier, as we wouldn't need to keep a full copy of the original text/code (and not using `push_*()` methods), and could instead get it from `text`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4448457064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4454376354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-4454376354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":4454376354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCYBjog","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T20:16:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T20:16:01Z","body":"@Cykyrios I appreciate the kind feedback!\r\n\r\nThe simple answer about Append_Text is no, no behavior of append_text is changed. I checked your example (and variants of it) on the official 4.6 build, and this build, and they behaved identically. The reason is more complex - the current writing on the documentation does not accurately describe the behavior of append text, and the internal behavior is a little confusing due to interacting with the Tag_Stack and internal item tree. My fix for the text field does not interact with any of that. \r\n\r\nPerformance wise, although I haven't tested significantly, I am fairly confident it should not be impacted. All of the logic that makes this work requires no loops, and no traversing the existing material. All O(1) additions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4454376354/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4996664108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114787#issuecomment-4996664108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114787","id":4996664108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKdMLLA","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T21:15:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T21:15:52Z","body":"Rebased to master as of July 16th","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4996664108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]